  "bio": "Nina is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in illustrative styles, turning skin into a canvas of intricate and unique designs. You can find her at Downtown Nampa's family-friendly tattoo and piercing parlor, where professionalism is as much a priority as artistry. To experience Nina's exceptional work, swing by 208 12th Avenue S in Nampa, or reach out to her at 208-461-1478 for bookings.",
